{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28037","headline":"春雪映早梅 · 庾敬休","name":"春雪映早梅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清晨凝雪彩，新候变庭梅。\n树爱春荣徧，窗惊曙色催。\n寒光添粉壁，积润履青苔。\n分明六出瑞，隐映几枝开。\n闻笛花疑落，挥琴兴转来。\n曲成非寡和，长使思悠哉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庾敬休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28037.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28037","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}